            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "order of lay-off. Annual contract teachers who have received a favorable recommendation from their principals shall then be recalled. Annual contract teachers with the longest district-wide seniority shall be recalled first. When district-wide seniority is the same, the annual contract teacher with the highest level certificate shall be recalled first. When district-wide seniority and certification are the same, a random selection list containing names of teachers with equal status shall be prepared to determine the order of recall.",
            "block_bbox": [
