        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Each teacher shall notify the District, in writing, of an address to which a letter of recall may be sent. The recall letter shall be by certified mail, return receipt requested. Within fifteen (15) calendar days of mailing the letter of recall, a teacher shall notify the District, in writing, whether he will accept reemployment. Failure to respond to the letter of recall within the time limit automatically terminates the teacher's right to recall.",
            "block_bbox": [
                54,
                237,
