        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Any teacher who has been laid-off shall remain on an eligibility for recall list for a period of three (3) years from the date of lay-off. At the close of that time period, the teacher shall not be eligible for preferential treatment as assured by this Article.",
